REHEARSAL 6 — the pre-baked fast path on the single-workspace layout (2026-08-01)
Host: linux, taps workspace checkout; every product is in-tree and every binary builds into the workspace's one target dir (no siblings, no pins, no resolution chain). Sequence: demo-up, beat-1 through beat-5, demo-down, one shell.
Occasion: the cold-parity run of the workspace migration — the first rehearsal on the single-workspace layout. It also caught environmental drift: the gitea/gitea:1.24 image now resolves to 1.24.7, whose issue API returns an empty list for the plural 'type=issues' the scripted reviewer gate (demo-trigger.sh) used; fixed to the documented 'type=issue'. Evidence classes match rehearsal 5: verify 6/6, byte-identical forge transcripts, CROSS-CHECK PASS, the measure-report page in the run's KB space, and the KB query close.

