 BEAT 2 — ASSESS  (pre-baked fast path)
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 TALKING POINT:
   An assessment that used to take a consultant weeks is authored in minutes
   from the client's own brief — on a 3B model running on this laptop. The
   output is not slideware: it is schema-validated YAML with mechanical
   quality gates (degeneracy, dedupe, leakage). The prior period's measured
   signals ride along as background context — the pulse report, plus
   tuesday's decision-attributed effort report once beat 5 has closed a
   period in this workdir. That is the loop's return edge.
   And the human gate: the client's architect reviews every question before
   it is ever asked.

